WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.368
You don't like watching yourself

2
00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.424
if you're in a dramatic role?

3
00:00:03.424 --> 00:00:06.123
But I love watching myself do comedy.

4
00:00:06.123 --> 00:00:09.123
(laughs and cheers)

5
00:00:12.914 --> 00:00:14.542
I don't know.

6
00:00:14.542 --> 00:00:18.200
Comedy, you're innately making fun of yourself.

7
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.476
It's very liberating.

8
00:00:20.476 --> 00:00:24.272
The more ridiculous you look, the more successful you are.

9
00:00:24.272 --> 00:00:26.272
But in a serious role...

10
00:00:27.589 --> 00:00:31.069
Nobody likes to see himself or herself up on screen.

11
00:00:31.069 --> 00:00:33.393
You all remember the first time you ever saw yourself.

12
00:00:33.393 --> 00:00:35.100
You completely freak out.

13
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.017
No actor completely overcomes that.

14
00:00:41.226 --> 00:00:43.496
The more serious you are, the more embarrassed.

15
00:00:43.496 --> 00:00:45.645
So I avoid myself when I'm serious.

16
00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:49.187
But I secretly watch 3rd Rock from the Sun reruns.

17
00:00:49.187 --> 00:00:50.907
(cheers)

18
00:00:50.907 --> 00:00:51.824
Life, life!

19
00:00:56.203 --> 00:00:57.036
What about you, Mel?

20
00:00:57.036 --> 00:00:59.190
Do you like to watch yourself on screen?

21
00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:00.718
It does make you kind of wriggly.

22
00:01:00.718 --> 00:01:01.978
I get pretty wriggly.

23
00:01:01.978 --> 00:01:03.601
I try not to do it.

24
00:01:03.601 --> 00:01:04.876
Other people give me reviews

25
00:01:04.876 --> 00:01:06.614
and that does me in completely.

26
00:01:06.614 --> 00:01:10.187
What about when you're watching a Mad Max movie

27
00:01:10.187 --> 00:01:12.296
or something from a long time ago?

28
00:01:12.296 --> 00:01:13.807
Does it bring you back to that time when you see it?

29
00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:14.706
No, it doesn't.

30
00:01:14.706 --> 00:01:16.733
I just feel the arthritis and the hemorrhoids.

31
00:01:16.733 --> 00:01:18.816
(laughs)

32
00:01:20.284 --> 00:01:23.100
And I hearken back to a time when those things didn't exist.

33
00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.433
And it was visibly apparent.

